<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 29.033A Top Lozenge with Pavilion</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Steele, Norman W: Seattle F Design, May 96, p1</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">This design is a modification, new pavilion, for 29.033</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">to experimentally compare with/without a pavilion.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.720</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">44 facets + 4 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.497</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.638 C/W = 0.277</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.375</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc29033a.asc</tspan>
